# RegressionHints.main: every menu item and button of the main window, and of
# the Car Inventory dialog, has a hover hint (Development Issues #80).
# -d missinghints=1 prints "Missing Help String: <name>" for each control
# created without one, and the test fails on that line.
VERSION 13 5.4.0
DEMOINIT
ROOMSIZE 40.000000 x 20.000000
SCALE HO
REDRAW
PARAMETER misc cmdCarInventory
PARAMETER carinv ok
